{
  "name": "ThreeStart",
  "description": "Entry point of every three-start project. Owns a single [`ThreeContext`](/docs/api/three-context),\nregisters modules and extra scenes, controls lifecycle (mount / loop / dispose), and bootstraps\nthe active scene on `start()`. Switch scenes with [`setScene`](/docs/api/three-start).",
